5Java Script 
•JavaScript is used to create client-side dynamic pages. (client-side 
validation) 
•JavaScript is an object-based scripting language that uses 
prototype. 
•JavaScript is light weight and interpreted 
•JavaScript is not a compiler based language. 
•It is case sensitive 
•It is supportable in different operating system . 
•It provide  good control to the user over the web browser. 
  Application 
•Dynamic Drop-down Menus 
•Displaying Date and Time 
•Displaying Pop-up window and dialog boxes. 
•Displaying clock 
 


