15Pop up Boxes 
▪Popup boxes can be used to raise an alert, or to get confirmation 
on any input or to have a kind of input from the users. 
▪JavaScript supports three  types of popup boxes. 
•Alert box 
•Confirm box 
•Prompt box 

--- Page 16 ---
