24Loops 
for loop 
Use when you know how 
many repetitions you want 
to do 
syntax 
for(initialize ; condition ; 
increment) { … }
example 
for(x=0;x<10;x++) { 
    // Code Here 
}
while loop 
Loops through block of code 
while condition is true 
syntax 
while(condition) { … }
example 
while (x<10) { 
     //Code Here 
}
do while loop 
Execute block at least once 
then repeat while condition 
is true 
syntax 
do{ … } while (condition); 
example 
do{
    // Code Here 
} while (x<10) 

