48Java Script Event 
▪ The change in the state of an object is known as an  Event . In html, 
there are various events which represents that some activity is 
performed by the user or by the browser. When  javascript  code is 
included in  HTML , js react over these events and allow the 
execution. This process of reacting over the events is called  Event 
Handling . Thus, js handles the HTML events via  Event Handlers .
▪ The  addEventListener()  method is used to attach an event handler 
to a particular element 
▪ element.addEventListener(event, function, useCapture);   
▪ Event:-It Is required parameter. It can be defined as a string that 
specifies the eventʼ s name. 
▪ function:  It is also a required parameter. It is a  JavaScript  
function  which responds to the event occur. 
▪ The parameters  e v ent  and  function  are widely used. The third 
parameter is optional to 

